#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(127)
msgctxt "SmartFoundations,P.SpacingIncrement"
msgid "Spacing Increment (m)"
msgstr "افزایش فاصله (متر)"

#: Mods/GameFeatures/SmartFoundations/Source/SmartFoundations/Private/Config/SmartFoundationsModConfiguration.cpp(128)
